{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:25:48",
      "utterance": "相談ありがとうございます。よろしくお願いします。",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:26:02",
      "utterance": "お願いします。",
      "distress_level": 0,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:26:18",
      "utterance": "こちらこそよろしくお願いします",
      "tag": "Greeting"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:26:51",
      "utterance": "はじめに年齢、性別、今日の相談したいことよろしくお願いいたします。",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:27:44",
      "utterance": "15歳　女　学校で嫌な事があって…",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:27:57",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:28:43",
      "utterance": "お名前はなんと、お呼びしたらいいですか❔",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:29:25",
      "utterance": "ココロでお願いします同級生4人で仲良かったのに今はバラバラで",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:30:04",
      "utterance": "ココロさん。ありがとうございます。",
      "tag": "Thanking"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:31:47",
      "utterance": "お友達４人とだったのに今はすれ違いなどでバラバラになっえるんですか❔",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:32:34",
      "utterance": "仲良しの友達とです。すみません",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:33:25",
      "utterance": "すれ違いでは無いけどなんだか、最近みんな冷たくて",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:34:29",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。そのことについて、もう少し詳しく聴いてもいいでしょうか❔",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:36:18",
      "utterance": "先週、4人で約束してたんだけど家の用事でその日に断ってその時は、オッケーで終わったと思っていたけど次の日から、みんな冷たくて",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:37:10",
      "utterance": "そんなことが、あったんですね。それは、お辛いですね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:37:44",
      "utterance": "辛いってゆうか…何で？って感じ",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:38:10",
      "utterance": "確かに、そうなりますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:38:35",
      "utterance": "お家の用事で仕方ないと思うので",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:38:43",
      "utterance": "1人は普通なんだけど、もう2人は、感じがいつもと変で",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:39:02",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:39:44",
      "utterance": "こっち見ながら、コソコソ話してたり",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:40:20",
      "utterance": "普通にしてる、お友達とは、そのことについて、相談したり、話せてますか❔",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:41:15",
      "utterance": "かげでコソコソはされたら嫌ですよね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:41:39",
      "utterance": "その子は、おはよう　とか普通だから、その事に気付いて無さそう　話してない",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:41:57",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:43:01",
      "utterance": "その、お友達以外の友達や家族、周りには相談したり、できる人はいますか❔",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:43:27",
      "utterance": "昨日、2人のうちの1人に話しかけたら　（はぁ〜？）とか言われた　怖くて　その場立ち去った",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:44:04",
      "utterance": "それは、いきなりされたら怖いですね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:44:13",
      "utterance": "誰にも相談するつもりはない大ごとになるのが嫌なので",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:45:32",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。確かに周りにばれたらと思うと怖いですよねSNSなんか拡散早いですし",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:45:49",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:47:10",
      "utterance": "今のココロさんの、お気持ちは仲良しだった、お友達とどうなりたいですか❔",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:47:44",
      "utterance": "仲良くなりたいです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:48:11",
      "utterance": "そうですよね。仲良くなりたいですよね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:48:49",
      "utterance": "もう、誘ってくれないかも…",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:49:13",
      "utterance": "そうなんですか。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:49:55",
      "utterance": "それは、冷たい態度からそう、思われますか❔",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:50:11",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:51:02",
      "utterance": "普通に話してる友達とみんなで話し合うことは難しいですか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:51:31",
      "utterance": "あの態度されたので勇気がないです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:51:51",
      "utterance": "そうですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:52:23",
      "utterance": "もう誘わないからって言われたらと思うと…涙が出ます",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:53:22",
      "utterance": "まだ、言われてはないですよね。",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:53:29",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:54:08",
      "utterance": "涙が出そうになるほどは、ほんとに、お辛いと思います",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:55:09",
      "utterance": "もう、泣いてます",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:55:55",
      "utterance": "泣いてしまってるんですね。お話しできますか❔大丈夫ですか",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:56:14",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:56:27",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます。",
      "tag": "Thanking"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:57:32",
      "utterance": "他にも相談したり、出来ないとより悩みますね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:57:57",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:59:00",
      "utterance": "ココロさんは、お友達と部活動や、趣味はどうですか❔",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T14:59:50",
      "utterance": "その子とも、部活が同じで…バレー部です",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:00:54",
      "utterance": "同じなんですね。バレー部では仲良くできてますか❔",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:01:49",
      "utterance": "コロナなので、練習はほぼ無い感じなので",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:02:08",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:02:43",
      "utterance": "趣味はあまり同じではないですか❔",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:04:11",
      "utterance": "先週は、コロナも落ち着いてるから皆んなでランチの約束してました　趣味は同じでは無いです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:04:39",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:05:50",
      "utterance": "先週の約束の後は、お友達にどんな感じで謝ったりしましたか❔",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:07:31",
      "utterance": "軽く　オッケーってLINE来たからその次の日、おはようって言ったら　目を合わせてくれなくて　めちゃくちゃ　テンション低く　おはようって…",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:08:36",
      "utterance": "そうだったんですね。それは、気まずくなったりしますよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:09:44",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:10:44",
      "utterance": "相談でお話しできてないことはありませんか❔大丈夫ですか",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:11:03",
      "utterance": "大丈夫です",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:11:24",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます。",
      "tag": "Thanking"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:13:52",
      "utterance": "今は辛いと思いますが、他のお友達とはどうですか❔",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:14:49",
      "utterance": "他の友達は普通です",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:15:09",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:16:48",
      "utterance": "仲良しの友達も普通に話せるようになれるといいですよね。うまく機会が作れたらと思いますが",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:17:45",
      "utterance": "月曜日、どんな顔して挨拶したらいいか　わからない…",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:18:04",
      "utterance": "学校行きたくないな〜",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:18:30",
      "utterance": "そうですよね。休み明けに学校に行きたくないですよね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:18:46",
      "utterance": "行かなくてもいいですか？",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:19:32",
      "utterance": "行かないと言う選択もありますが",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:21:02",
      "utterance": "ほんとに行きたくないのであればですが、でも出来たら、また友達とは仲良くなれたらと思う気持ちもあると思うので。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:22:40",
      "utterance": "でも…相手の対応がもっとひどくなったらと思うと怖いです",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:22:55",
      "utterance": "少し勇気だして挨拶してみるのもいいと思いますよ。あの時はごめんねなんて、",
      "tag": "Suggest"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:23:29",
      "utterance": "確かに相手の反応凄く怖いと思います。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:23:42",
      "utterance": "何度も　もう1週間　やってみたけど…変わりません",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:24:04",
      "utterance": "そうなんですね。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:24:36",
      "utterance": "挨拶しても変わらないのは、辛いですね。",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:24:43",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:25:31",
      "utterance": "学校には、もう行きたくないですか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:25:50",
      "utterance": "月曜日が憂鬱です",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:26:34",
      "utterance": "憂鬱な気持ちになりますよね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:26:41",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:27:29",
      "utterance": "そろそろお時間ですが、今日は相談してみていかがでしたか❔",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:28:17",
      "utterance": "聞いてもらったけど泣いちゃいました。ありがとうございました",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:28:47",
      "utterance": "友達って難しい",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2021-11-06T15:28:54",
      "utterance": "こちらこそありがとうございました。",
      "tag": "Thanking"
    },
